WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Capture the meeting. Read it back.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
No bot. Both voices, captured on your Mac.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The meeting's sound, not the notifications.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Stop, and the file is always finalized.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Transcription starts when you stop — timestamped, by speaker.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
A first-draft summary, ready to edit.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Every recording becomes searchable.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
All on your Mac. — kilde
